The FFI layer in lib/notcurses/ffi.rb and lib/notcurses/ffi/ is generated from
the notcurses 3.0.17 public headers. lib/notcurses/ffi/inline_reimpl.rb
reimplements the static inline functions of those headers and quotes their C
source in comments.
